{"step_index":388,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-23T20:26:03Z","content":"# 🚀 CodeDuel is Live!\n\nBoth the **Spring Boot Core Backend Engine** and the **React + Vite Frontend** are running.\n\n---\n\n## 🌐 URLs & Access Points\n\n| Service | URL | Description |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **Frontend Web App** | [`http://localhost:5173/`](http://localhost:5173/) | Real-time 1v1 Arena, Dashboard, 1,000 Questions Practice, Leaderboard |\n| **Backend REST API** | [`http://localhost:8080/api`](http://localhost:8080/api) | Spring Boot REST Endpoints |\n| **OpenAPI / Swagger** | [`http://localhost:8080/swagger-ui.html`](http://localhost:8080/swagger-ui.html) | Interactive REST API Documentation |\n| **H2 Console** | [`http://localhost:8080/h2-console`](http://localhost:8080/h2-console) | In-Memory Database Inspector (`jdbc:h2:mem:codedueldb`, User: `sa`, Password: empty) |\n\n---\n\n## 🔑 Pre-Seeded Contender Accounts\n\nYou can click any of the **Quick Demo Login** buttons on the sign-in page:\n\n| Username | Password | Rating | Role | Profile / Highlights |\n| :--- | :--- | :---: | :---: | :--- |\n| **`anshu`** | `password123` | **1542** | `ROLE_USER` | Win Rate 68%, 42 Wins, 5 Win Streak |\n| **`rahul`** | `password123` | **1518** | `ROLE_USER` | Diamond Tier, 38 Wins |\n| **`aman`** | `password123` | **1791** | `ROLE_USER` | Top 3 Contender, 110 Wins |\n| **`admin`** | `admin123` | **2100** | `ROLE_ADMIN` | Grandmaster & Full Admin Management |\n\n---\n\n## 🎮 How to Test the 1v1 Versus Experience\n\n1. **Open two browser windows** (or one standard window + one incognito window) at [`http://localhost:5173/`](http://localhost:5173/).\n2. **Login**:\n   - Window 1: Login as **`anshu`**\n   - Window 2: Login as **`rahul`**\n3. **Queue for Duel**:\n   - In both windows, click **`FIND MATCH`** on the Dashboard or navigate to `/versus`.\n   - The radar will scan, match the two players in the rating window, trigger the **`3... 2... 1... GO!`** animation, and redirect both contenders into `/versus/:matchId`.\n4. **Solve & Battle**:\n   - Code in the **Monaco Code Editor** (Java, Python, C++, or JavaScript).\n   - Watch the live opponent status card update in real time (**Coding**, **Running Tests**, **$x/y$ Tests Passed**).\n   - Click **`Submit Solution`** (`Ctrl + Enter`) to execute against all sandbox test cases.\n   - The winner is decided based on **Correctness $\\to$ Normalized Efficiency (70% Runtime + 30% Memory) $\\to$ Speed**, showing the confetti victory screen, updated Elo ratings, and side-by-side performance analysis!"}
